The variables in the modeling data set are as follows: 
  
score: The score for the school 
opp_score: The score for the opponent
school: The school name 
class: The class of the school 
opp: The opposing school's name 
opp_class: The opposing school's class 
h_a_n: A factor variable with "a", "n", "h" representing the location of the game as away, neutral site, or home
date: The date of the game in "YYYY-MM-DD" format
season: The season of the game in "YYYY" format, each season is represented by the year the season ends in
game_id: A unique identifier for each game
district: The district of the school
g: The number of prior games played in the season by the school
OWE: Offensive Weighted Efficiency - A weighted measure of offensive performance that uses points scored by the team compared to average points allowed by the opponent
DWE: Defensive Weighted Efficiency - A weighted measure of defensive performance that uses points allowed by the team compared to average points scored by the opponent
o_rate: Offensive Rate - A measure of the team's offensive efficiency using points per estimated possesstion above what the opponent would generally allow per possession and multiplied by 100 possession. An average offensive team will have an o_rate of 0
d_rate: Defensive Rate - A measure of the team's defensive efficiency using points per estimated possession above what the opponent would generally score per possession and multiplied by 100 possessions. An average defensive team will have a d_rate of 0
ppg: Points per game for the school
papg: Points allowed per game for the school
eff_margin: Efficiency Margin - The difference between the OWE and DWE, a measure of overall team efficiency
pts_margin: Points Margin - The difference between ppg and papg, a measure of overall scoring margin
wins: The number of wins for the school in the season
losses: The number of losses for the school in the season
wp: Win Percentage - The percentage of games won by the school in the season
owp: Opponent Win Percentage - The average win percentage of the school's opponents in the season
oowp: Opponent Opponent Win Percentage - The average win percentage of the opponents' opponents in the season
rpi: Ratings Percentage Index - A measure of the team's strength of schedule and performance, calculated using .25 * wp + .5 * owp + .25 * oowp
avg_pace: Average Pace - The average number of estimated possessions per game for the school
ocv: Opponents class value - A measure of the average class value of the school's opponents
cv: Class Value - A measure of the school's class value based on the classification of the school
oocv: Opponent Opponents Class Value - A measure of the average class value of the opponents' opponents
crpi: Class Ratings Percentage Index - A measure of the team's strength of schedule based on class, calculated as .25 * cv + .5 * ocv + .25 * oocv
district_opp: The district of the opposing school
g_opp: The number of prior games played in the season by the opposing school
OWE_opp: Offensive Weighted Efficiency for the opposing school
DWE_opp: Defensive Weighted Efficiency for the opposing school
o_rate_opp: Offensive Rate for the opposing school
d_rate_opp: Defensive Rate for the opposing school
ppg_opp: Points per game for the opposing school
papg_opp: Points allowed per game for the opposing school
eff_margin_opp: Efficiency Margin for the opposing school
pts_margin_opp: Points Margin for the opposing school
wins_opp: The number of wins for the opposing school in the season
losses_opp: The number of losses for the opposing school in the season
wp_opp: Win Percentage for the opposing school in the season
owp_opp: Opponent Win Percentage for the opposing school in the season
oowp_opp: Opponent Opponent Win Percentage for the opposing school in the season
rpi_opp: Ratings Percentage Index for the opposing school
avg_pace_opp: Average Pace for the opposing school
ocv_opp: Opponents class value for the opposing school
cv_opp: Class Value for the opposing school
oocv_opp: Opponent Opponents Class Value for the opposing school
crpi_opp: Class Ratings Percentage Index for the opposing school
ppg_ly: Points per game for the school in the last season
papg_ly: Points allowed per game for the school in the last season
OWE_ly: Offensive Weighted Efficiency for the school in the last season
DWE_ly: Defensive Weighted Efficiency for the school in the last season
o_rate_ly: Offensive Rate for the school in the last season
d_rate_ly: Defensive Rate for the school in the last season
avg_pace_ly: Average Pace for the school in the last season
crpi_ly: Class Ratings Percentage Index for the school in the last season
rpi_ly: Ratings Percentage Index for the school in the last season
